mapping "TA.1" source="TA" target="b1" relationship=related_to {
 confidence 2 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
 comment "en" """
 Source TA is the KSI chapter grouping for
 social-service activities concerning mental functions (assessment, support, intervention); child
 TA1 carries @ICF: b1. Mental functions are a Body Functions domain, not an Activities &
 Participation chapter — KSI re-frames function-related intervention as 'activities'. Target ICF
 b1 is the ICF Body Functions chapter 1 (Mental functions) root, the
 functional concept the KSI interventions concern. Related link : the source is about the b1
 domain (intervention/intervention-concerning), not co-extensive with the functions themselves;
 ICF has no equivalent for the intervention framing. Per related-vs-no_match boundary rule the
 association is real and reviewer-worthy.
 """ suspect=quoted-text
}
