mapping "UA-UE.1" source="UA-UE" target="e" relationship=related_to {
 confidence 2 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
 comment "en" """
 Source UA-UE is the KSI chapter grouping for
 social-service activities concerning environmental factors. Environmental factors are a separate
 ICF component (the e-codes / contextual factors), not an Activities & Participation chapter —
 KSI re-frames environment-related intervention as 'activities'. Target ICF e
 is the ICF Environmental Factors component root, the contextual domain the
 KSI interventions concern. Related link : the source is about the e-component domain
 (intervention-concerning), not co-extensive with the environmental factors themselves; ICF has
 no equivalent for the intervention framing.
 """ suspect=quoted-text
}
